   <refbody><section><p>A user needs to deploy a cloud application. The documentation guides them through:</p>
<table frame="all" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
            <title>documentation stages and topic types</title>
            <tgroup cols="3">
               <colspec colname="c1"/>
               <colspec colname="c2"/>
               <colspec colname="c3"/>
               <thead>
                  <row>
                     <entry>Stage</entry>
                     <entry>Topic Type</entry>
                     <entry>Content</entry>
                  </row>                  
               </thead>
               <tbody>
                  <row>
                     <entry>Understanding</entry>
                     <entry>Concept</entry>
                     <entry>What is cloud deployment? What are the benefits?</entry>
                  </row>
                  <row>
                     <entry>Preparation</entry>
                     <entry>Task</entry>
                     <entry>How do I prepare my environment?</entry>
                  </row>
                  <row>
                     <entry>Action</entry>
                     <entry>Task</entry>
                     <entry>How do I deploy the application?</entry>
                  </row>
                  <row>
                     <entry>Verification</entry>
                     <entry>Task</entry>
                     <entry>How do I verify the deployment succeeded?</entry>
                  </row>
                  <row>
                     <entry>Look up</entry>
                     <entry>Reference</entry>
                     <entry>What are all the deployment parameters?</entry>
                  </row>
                  <row>
                     <entry>Problem-solving</entry>
                     <entry>Troubleshooting</entry>
                     <entry>What if deployment fails?</entry>
                  </row>
                  <row>
                     <entry>Definition Lookup</entry>
                     <entry>Glossary</entry>
                     <entry>What do terms like “IaaS,” “CI/CD,” or specific parameter names mean?</entry>
                  </row>
               </tbody>
            </tgroup>
         </table>
<p>This progression reflects how users naturally consume information. It moves from understanding to action to lookup.</p></section></refbody>
